@startuml
title LMS v1.1 — CR1 Implementation Class Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class LecturerWindow {
  -database: Database&
  -lecturerId: int
  +grantDeadlineExtension()
}

class StudentWindow {
  -database: Database&
  -studentId: int
  +loadAssignments()
}

class Database {
  +createTables(): bool
  +grantAssignmentExtension(lecturerId, assignmentId, studentId, deadline, reason, error): bool
  +grantClassAssignmentExtension(lecturerId, assignmentId, deadline, reason, error): bool
  +getStudentAssignments(studentId, assignments): bool
  +submitAssignment(studentId, assignmentId, fileReference): bool
  +getSubmissionMarkingContext(lecturerId, submissionId, context, error): bool
}

class StudentAssignmentRecord {
  +assignmentId: int
  +deadline: string
  +deadlineExtension: string
  +latestVersion: int
  +latestStatus: string
}

LecturerWindow --> Database : selects scope and grants
StudentWindow --> Database : loads assignment rows
Database ..> StudentAssignmentRecord : returns effective deadline

note right of Database
  Effective deadline =
  max(original, class, individual).
  Class extensions are assignment-scoped;
  individual extensions remain student-scoped.
end note
@enduml
